Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.36,0:01:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不懂的问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.91,0:02:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好集中精力听课哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师找你有点事.过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道找你来这儿的理由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:02:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把那里..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡说些什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.23,0:03:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想老师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.85,0:03:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舔我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡巴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡说八道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是来小便的不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就撒尿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师要看着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为老师还从没见过男性尿尿的样子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.30,0:03:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得想瞧瞧你的糗样儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真要看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要出来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.19,0:04:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么撒的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好..大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好热乎哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以摸摸看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.15,0:04:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等.不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师把鸡巴给你拿住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为老师.把那里摸兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越来越大了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢摸咪咪的赶脚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为啥这么说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,微微发透哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边儿也摸摸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么搞的话.尿根本撒不出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让老师仔细瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡巴硬邦邦的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这根鸡巴真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.31,0:05:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尿骚四溢哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.这个好爽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师的舌头舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.91,0:06:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好软啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这咪咪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望老师怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我摸摸什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸一摸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者给我舔舔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己把衬衫撩开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.24,0:07:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是.要是有人来了怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都还在用功呢.没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上课时间真没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想回教室吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样回去吗.不想给鸡巴解解闷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是.好难为情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舔了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吗.哪个更舒服些呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡鸡和咪咪哪个？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个都.好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个都很有感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要出来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.80,0:08:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么要出来了.嘘嘘吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是嘘嘘啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师就别卖关子了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尿以外的东西要出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.55,0:08:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来.脱掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸那儿很危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在这模样好羞羞哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.35,0:08:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.别看了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正紧紧盯着哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉被老师侵犯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡巴变得好烫手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,碉堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.不是尿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另外的东西要喷出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想射出另外的东西吗.要老师帮你一把吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再把硬鸡巴给老师瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.27,0:09:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师帮你舔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来.帮你舔干净
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淫荡的鸡汁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淫荡鸡汁好美味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你塞喉咙里没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样.插在喉咙里舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师的嘴真是深不可测
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师的嘴穴舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爽到爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脑子都快爽坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直酸爽.慢慢儿地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师的嘴里.好温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.不可以吐出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.让我全都射你嘴里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往老师的嘴穴里.狠狠射吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗.那我不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.还可以射点儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.00,0:17:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.我要射了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.84,0:19:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在喉咙里搅成了一团
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次再请老师吃到饱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.77,0:20:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你挺忙的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.76,0:21:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在这儿只有你我二人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就像上次一样..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.请你别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前你不是那么淫荡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.53,0:21:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.请别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次也一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那会儿是那会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得那会儿吗.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你不要误会哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌粗暴的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想必老师也知道.我喜欢小鲜肉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.26,0:21:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.60,0:22:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.42,0:22:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.79,0:22:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师嘴上这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实在勾引我对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊.等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得羞耻吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.43,0:22:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过对.你这种禽兽没兴趣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.23,0:22:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.65,0:22:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实你.是在勾引我对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师\N哪有勾引啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.91,0:22:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,口是心非
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.37,0:22:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.98,0:22:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我老实点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.81,0:22:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:22:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你不好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:23:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听好了.给我老实点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.51,0:23:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变态
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实老师也是求之不得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.81,0:23:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师在这之前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.22,0:23:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比我不是更禽兽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哪有禽兽过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要舔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.19,0:23:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实点儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.43,0:24:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.84,0:24:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.我爱死你了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.32,0:24:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.41,0:24:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.37,0:24:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.92,0:24:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你爱我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.78,0:24:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,千真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.18,0:24:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱死你了我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这骚臀.这美腿.全都是我喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.39,0:24:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.70,0:24:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个变态
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.22,0:24:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么叫我都行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.56,0:24:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被别人叫变态很开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.60,0:24:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欣喜若狂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.94,0:24:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真美好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.69,0:25:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经热得不行了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.95,0:25:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.50,0:25:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.30,0:25:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师亲嘴儿太骚气了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.76,0:26:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么骚.让人欲拒还迎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.90,0:26:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.62,0:26:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美轮美奂
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.83,0:26:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,百蹭不厌啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.73,0:26:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.47,0:26:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.10,0:26:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巨开心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.43,0:26:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再埋进去点
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.85,0:27:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.80,0:27:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好美味
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.32,0:27:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.42,0:27:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.75,0:27:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我品尝一下吧.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.90,0:27:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.86,0:27:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我一直注视着舔屁屁的你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.56,0:28:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的骚屁眼儿.就这么美味吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.10,0:28:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.37,0:28:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.35,0:28:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃吗\N好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.19,0:28:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽情品尝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.78,0:28:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以再往里怼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.80,0:28:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.18,0:28:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来和我这人渣接吻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.94,0:28:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.19,0:28:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以给你爆掉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.21,0:29:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再禽兽一点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.87,0:29:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,禽兽正对我狂舔不止
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.68,0:29:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里越来越热了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.30,0:29:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师的逼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.49,0:29:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.90,0:29:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿也爽？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿也是？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.56,0:29:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.41,0:29:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.29,0:30:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美如画
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.65,0:30:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好大一只舌头
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.40,0:30:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师的那里也变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.10,0:30:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的那里好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.54,0:30:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.95,0:30:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.83,0:30:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽情品尝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.40,0:31:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看着你舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.40,0:31:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的液体不停地溢出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.48,0:31:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太淫荡
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.14,0:31:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,使劲吸这些黏黏的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.80,0:31:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师也饥渴难耐了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.50,0:32:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方很亢奋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.51,0:32:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望老师舔一舔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.22,0:32:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.25,0:32:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.62,0:32:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.87,0:32:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再往里点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.23,0:33:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就喜欢大的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.86,0:33:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往里怼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.74,0:33:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢儿地
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.91,0:33:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太爽了.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.41,0:34:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淫荡的唾液哗哗地流出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.86,0:34:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃得再香一点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.36,0:34:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蛋蛋也要舔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.47,0:34:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.20,0:35:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢这只鸡巴是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.22,0:35:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡巴好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.36,0:35:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欲罢不能对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.34,0:35:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好想操逼啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.54,0:35:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来插我的逼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.92,0:35:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.73,0:35:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你整个插进去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.61,0:35:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事不宜迟
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.25,0:35:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.舒爽
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.65,0:36:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这逼厉害啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.49,0:36:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,禽兽鸡巴操着好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.76,0:36:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师也会变成禽兽哦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.92,0:36:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逼夹得梆梆紧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.36,0:36:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己把腰挥动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.88,0:36:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,腿抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.15,0:36:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黏乎乎的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.36,0:37:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舒不舒服？\N好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.94,0:37:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,禽兽鸡巴就是舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.99,0:37:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就操再狠点儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.38,0:37:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好.鸡巴使劲儿操吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.93,0:37:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.爽爆
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.28,0:37:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师也变成兽逼了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兽逼操着舒服吗\N爽无敌
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.37,0:38:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.甚好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.23,0:38:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这逼不得了啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.53,0:38:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.62,0:39:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡巴操着舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.26,0:39:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再操凶点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.13,0:39:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错.舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.94,0:39:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,张开
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.45,0:39:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,腿抬起来.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.91,0:40:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开了操
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.42,0:40:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.18,0:40:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.48,0:41:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师真是步步紧逼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.82,0:41:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逼操舒服没有
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.94,0:41:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.37,0:41:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手撑住后面
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.38,0:42:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越黏越好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.76,0:42:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,使劲儿吮吸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.54,0:42:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这根鸡巴很美味吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.26,0:42:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再给我舔舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.50,0:42:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.28,0:43:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.15,0:43:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喉咙里面舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.88,0:43:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师你这个骚货
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.64,0:44:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别浪费了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.78,0:44:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往喉咙里灌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.27,0:44:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点坐上来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.69,0:44:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐鸡巴上来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.66,0:44:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来亲个嘴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.37,0:44:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.55,0:44:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.21,0:45:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真淫荡
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.15,0:46:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.鸡巴撑不住啦.啊老师
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.28,0:46:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屌炸了.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.36,0:47:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,禽兽精子怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.70,0:47:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,禽兽精子好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.63,0:48:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.71,0:48:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道来这里的理由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.67,0:48:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师从其他同学那有听说.铃木君
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.72,0:48:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是处男吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.58,0:48:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不.不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.59,0:48:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.36,0:48:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是第一次和老师..
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.20,0:48:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这孩子真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.20,0:48:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那让老师疼爱疼爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.90,0:48:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,躺下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.30,0:48:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.87,0:48:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.28,0:49:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸一摸哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.27,0:49:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难为情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.30,0:49:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变大了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.15,0:49:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,羞死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.87,0:49:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很羞人？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.66,0:49:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事.老师也觉得羞羞的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.55,0:49:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉链帮你拉开哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.38,0:49:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.85,0:49:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.41,0:50:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还遮住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.23,0:50:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.19,0:50:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么遮遮掩掩的.还怎么舔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.60,0:50:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太羞人了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.50,0:50:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不想让老师舔舔看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.40,0:50:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然就只能当万年老处男哦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.73,0:50:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡巴好大一根呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.30,0:50:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不觉得奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.81,0:51:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不奇怪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.26,0:51:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前面热乎乎的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.70,0:51:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡皮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.50,0:51:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以上下搓动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.78,0:51:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊.脱皮了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.21,0:51:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再给你包回去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.19,0:51:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好难为情
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.97,0:51:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来很舒服的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.89,0:51:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,节奏可以在激烈点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.17,0:52:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师的舌头感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.23,0:52:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很柔软吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.48,0:52:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.21,0:52:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.78,0:52:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越发往里钻了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.99,0:52:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都吃到根部了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.73,0:53:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师.握住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.74,0:53:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡鸡都撞到喉咙里了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.70,0:54:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撞到喉咙了哦.感觉到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.33,0:54:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃不腻
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.82,0:55:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.22,0:55:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃\N好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.65,0:56:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.30,0:57:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.82,0:57:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忍不住啦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.83,0:57:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.66,0:57:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不可以射哦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.98,0:57:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还想多品尝会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.22,0:58:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.34,0:58:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想瞧瞧老师那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.59,0:59:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么味儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.16,0:59:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好闻
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.05,0:59:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师这里热起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.65,0:59:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好闻啊
Dialogue: 1,0:59:33.13,0:59:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想揉奶子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.32,0:59:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师的身体变热了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.77,0:59:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来摸吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.66,1:00:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热包子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.84,1:00:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为很兴奋嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.61,1:00:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.07,1:00:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实老师也很难为情哦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.52,1:00:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快摸咪咪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.80,1:00:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女性的这个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.10,1:00:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么摸才合适呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.02,1:01:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像这样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.49,1:01:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捏捏看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.46,1:01:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.15,1:01:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,硬邦邦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.24,1:01:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.75,1:01:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以捏啊捏
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.25,1:01:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样摸啊摸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.06,1:01:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.59,1:01:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手指尽量动起来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.85,1:01:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.62,1:01:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.03,1:01:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来舔舔奶子吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.40,1:02:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师 舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.95,1:02:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很舒服哦\N真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.62,1:02:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小舌头好乖
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.83,1:02:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把老师的奶子舔个够吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.94,1:02:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想舔吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.94,1:03:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗
